AmazIEEE

REQUIERMENTS
fUNCTIONAL REQUIERMENT:
1.Customers can browse products
2.create order
2.add them to a order
3.confirm order and payment
3.Customers can track their order status
4.Customer Notifications about the status of the status
5.The system receives orders.
6. The system checks that every item is available and reserves it. 
7.The system decides how many robots are needed to collect it.
8.The system sends pick tasks to the assigned robots and follows their progress.
9.Packing & Handoff: When all robots assigned to an order have finished, the system knows the order is fully collected, 
and it moves the order to the packing station and then to shipping.
10.The system notifies operators about important events.
